-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 21.2.2008 (הסתדרות המורים) — תוספת שכר במגזר הציבורי
-- בגין התקופה שבין 1.7.05 - 31.12.09: the wage agreement of the 2008 round
-- between the State and הסתדרות המורים, signed before the general
-- public-sector agreement it waits on. Its period (to 31.12.2009) and whom
-- it covers (every employee in the teaching scale, of the State); the wage
-- supplement of 1.5%, 3% and 5% on the combined salary and תוספת 2001 at
-- their December 2007 value, the shekel supplements updated with it; the
-- correction to the general agreement's rates and dates where they are
-- higher or earlier, and the further supplements it gives all active
-- workers; disputes, exhaustion of claims, industrial peace, earlier
-- agreements and the follow-up committee.
--
-- WHAT IT CARRIES OUT: §76 of the reform agreement of 10.9.2007 (imported)
-- puts the general agreement's cost frame on the teachers' old pay, and its
-- §88 promises a wage agreement between the State and הסתדרות המורים at
-- §76's rates and dates once the general agreement is signed. This is that
-- agreement, brought forward (preamble ¶11); §6 exhausts §§76 and 88.
-- THE GENERAL AGREEMENT is the framework agreement of 17.4.2008 (imported;
-- convention instruments.general-wage-agreement), whose cost frame §4(יא)
-- compares with (א) and (ז), and whose further supplements §4(יב) passes on.
--
-- Its §4 prints the words of §4 of the Oz LaTmura agreement of 24.1.2008
-- (ארגון המורים's), save (יא), which names only the Histadrut's agreement,
-- and the split of (ח) into (ח)–(ט). The rules are encoded here and not
-- imported from it: §4(י) of that agreement imports THIS one, so the import
-- cannot run the other way. The twins are held to each other, and this one
-- to its round, in l4/tests/2008-02-21_teachers_tosefet-2008_wage-supplement-tests.l4.
--
-- Its claim on the 2008 supplement is stated in the shared vocabulary
-- (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4). No root includes it yet: agreements/teachers-general
-- has no family root (MMS-548). The agreement of 17.6.2009 puts (א)(3) off
-- to the salary of October 2011
-- (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2009-06-17_teachers_wage-update-deferral.l4,
-- which imports this file); the rules here are the agreement as signed.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT collective_agreements_law
IMPORT `2008-04-17_framework-agreement_public-sector`
IMPORT `2007-09-10_ofek-hadash_reform-founding-agreement`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — תוספת שכר במגזר הציבורי בגין התקופה שבין 1.7.05 - 31.12.09 (הסתדרות המורים, 21.2.2008)`

DECLARE `2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `show the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement on its own payslip line`
    `act to recognise the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement as fixed for the pensions law`
    `pay the teachers a further supplement the public-sector agreement gives all active workers`
    `strike over a matter the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement settled`
    `lock out over a matter the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement settled`
    `decide a dispute over the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp, its year and signature illegible; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The first party, the State, and who represents it (the wages commissioner and the Ministry's Director-General); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The State's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The second party, הסתדרות המורים, and its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the parties set the understandings down in a collective agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p13 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶3: the day of signing, written in by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim wage agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 21 2 2008

-- ¶10–¶11: §76(א) of the reform agreement of 10.9.2007 (imported) puts the
-- cost frame of the general public-sector wage agreement on the salary of
-- the teachers' wage agreements, at its rates and dates; the parties bring
-- forward the signing of the teachers' agreement, from the dates and at the
-- rates agreed to be set in the general agreement. The general agreement
-- was signed after this one, on 17.4.2008 (imported).
@ref akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11
`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement was signed before the general agreement` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim wage agreement was signed on` LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL `the 2008 framework agreement was signed on`

#ASSERT `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement was signed before the general agreement`

§§ `1 מבוא`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement's preamble is part of it` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תחולת ההסכם`

-- §2: every employee in the teaching employees' scale ("עובדי הוראה"). The
-- one employer that signs it is the State (preamble ¶4), so it is a special
-- collective agreement, and it reaches a teaching employee of the State,
-- whichever union he belongs to (the Collective Agreements Law, §15,
-- imported); a local authority's or another owner's teacher is outside it.
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH AN `employee a collective agreement may reach`
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement's teacher, as the law asks` c IS
    `employee a collective agreement may reach` WITH
        `his employer is a party to the agreement`  IS c's `employer` EQUALS `employed by the State`
        `his employer is represented for it by an employers' organisation that is a party` IS FALSE
        `his employer was or became a member of an employers' organisation that is a party` IS FALSE
        `his employer was expressly left out of the agreement` IS FALSE
        `he is of a kind of employee the agreement includes` IS TRUE
        `he is in an occupation or post the agreement includes` IS TRUE

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teaching employee of the agreement of 21.2.2008` c IF
    `a special collective agreement applies to the employee` (`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement's teacher, as the law asks` c)

§§ `3 תקופת ההסכם`

-- §3: to 31.12.2009, the day in (convention dates.end).
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement's period` d IF
    d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2009)

§§ `4 תוספת שכר במגזר הציבורי בגין התקופה שבין 1.7.05 - 31.12.09`

-- (א): the wage supplement ("תוספת השכר"), computed on the combined salary
-- and תוספת 2001: from the salary of January 2008, 1.5%; from that of
-- December 2008, completed to 3%; from that of December 2009, completed
-- to 5%. "השלמה ל-" makes each figure the whole rate from its month.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate` c IS
    BRANCH IF `the salary month is at least` c 2009 12 THEN 5%
           IF `the salary month is at least` c 2008 12 THEN 3%
           IF `the salary month is at least` c 2008 1 THEN 1.5%
           OTHERWISE 0

-- (ט): the supplement and the update of the shekel supplements are
-- computed on the salary components at their value in December 2007 —
-- the teacher's components valued as they stood that month, which is what
-- the shared case's `combined salary in December 2007` and `supplement
-- 2001 in December 2007` hold.
@ref akn:art_4__para_i
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base of the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement` c IS
    c's `combined salary in December 2007` PLUS c's `supplement 2001 in December 2007`

-- (ב): a separate supplement, on its own line of the teacher's payslip;
-- the State is the employer that signs it.
@ref akn:art_4__para_b
`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement's payslip line` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `show the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement on its own payslip line`

DECLARE `what the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement might count for` IS ONE OF
    `percentage supplements on the combined salary, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`
    `the 2001 supplement, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`
    `the hour value, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`
    `severance pay, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`
    `pensions, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`
    `pension, training-fund and Dafna contributions, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`
    `other contributions and deductions usual on the combined salary, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`
    `topping up to the minimum wage, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`

-- (ג): salary for every purpose — percentage supplements on the combined
-- salary save תוספת 2001, the hour value, severance pay, pensions,
-- contributions to pension, the training fund and Dafna, and every other
-- contribution or deduction usual on the combined salary. (ה): not in
-- topping up to the minimum wage. (ו): (ה) is no precedent, and no ground
-- for the teachers to claim the like in other agreements.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c akn:art_4__para_e akn:art_4__para_f
GIVEN p IS A `what the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement might count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement counts for` p IF
        NOT p EQUALS `the 2001 supplement, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`
    AND NOT p EQUALS `topping up to the minimum wage, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`

`(ה) is a precedent for other agreements` MEANS FALSE

-- (ד): the State acts to have the supplement recognised as a fixed
-- supplement for the State Service (Pensions) Law (outside the corpus; no
-- deadline: convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_4__para_d
`recognising the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement for pension` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `act to recognise the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement as fixed for the pensions law`

`why the State Service (Pensions) Law is not in the agreement of 21.2.2008` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק שירות המדינה (גמלאות) [נוסח משולב], התש\"ל-1970"

-- (ז): the shekel supplements are updated at the same rates and dates:
-- 1.5% from the salary of January 2008, completed to 3% from December 2008
-- and to 5% from December 2009, on their December 2007 value ((ט)).
@ref akn:art_4__para_g akn:art_4__para_g__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_g__subpara_2 akn:art_4__para_g__subpara_3
GIVEN `the shekel supplement in December 2007` IS A NUMBER, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the shekel supplement as the agreement of 21.2.2008 updates it` `the shekel supplement in December 2007` c IS
    `the shekel supplement in December 2007` TIMES (1 PLUS `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim shekel update rate` c)

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim shekel update rate` c IS
    BRANCH IF `the salary month is at least` c 2009 12 THEN 5%
           IF `the salary month is at least` c 2008 12 THEN 3%
           IF `the salary month is at least` c 2008 1 THEN 1.5%
           OTHERWISE 0

-- (ח): "the shekel supplements" are those paid to teaching employees and
-- in the teaching scale on the eve of the signing, save a supplement not
-- updated by the cost-of-living agreements that has a mechanism of its own,
-- and save the top-up to the minimum wage under the Minimum Wage Law.
@desc A shekel supplement, as far as section 4(ח) of the agreement of 21.2.2008 asks.
DECLARE `shekel supplement of 21.2.2008` HAS
    `in the teaching scale on the eve of 21.2.2008` IS A BOOLEAN
    `updated by the cost-of-living agreements` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has an update mechanism of its own` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is the minimum-wage top-up` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_4__para_h
GIVEN s IS A `shekel supplement of 21.2.2008`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `(ז) updates the shekel supplement` s IF
        s's `in the teaching scale on the eve of 21.2.2008`
    AND NOT (s's `has an update mechanism of its own` AND NOT s's `updated by the cost-of-living agreements`)
    AND NOT s's `is the minimum-wage top-up`

-- (י): nothing at all under this section for periods of work before
-- 1.1.08.
@ref akn:art_4__para_j
GIVEN `the work was done on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 21.2.2008 may pay for work done on` `the work was done on` IF
    `the work was done on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008)

-- (יא): where the public-sector wage-supplement agreement the New General
-- Histadrut signs has higher rates or earlier dates, (א)'s and (ז)'s are
-- corrected to them: in each month, the higher of this agreement's rate
-- and its. It is the framework agreement of 17.4.2008, imported, at its
-- cost frame's rates and dates (convention
-- instruments.general-wage-agreement). Unlike §4(י) of the Oz LaTmura
-- agreement it names no agreement of a teachers' union.
@ref akn:art_4__para_ja
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate after §4(יא)` c IS
    max (`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate` c) (`the 2008 framework cost frame on` (c's `the salary month`))

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim shekel update rate after §4(יא)` c IS
    max (`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim shekel update rate` c) (`the 2008 framework cost frame on` (c's `the salary month`))

-- The supplement as (א) sets it, (ט) bases it and (יא) corrects it.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement` c IS
    `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate after §4(יא)` c TIMES `the base of the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement` c

-- (יב): further wage supplements the public-sector agreement gives all the
-- active workers are paid to the teaching employees too. The framework's
-- one-time grant of 2008 (its §8) is paid to every active employee it
-- covers, and is the allocation of its 1.5% for 2008 (its §8.1), which
-- (א)(1) already pays the teachers as a rise: no further supplement
-- (convention instruments.general-wage-agreement; finding F-hh-2008-a).
@ref akn:art_4__para_jb
GIVEN `given to all active workers` IS A BOOLEAN
      `allocates a part of the cost frame (א) already pays` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§4(יב) passes the supplement on to the teachers` `given to all active workers` `allocates a part of the cost frame (א) already pays` IF
    `given to all active workers` AND NOT `allocates a part of the cost frame (א) already pays`

`paying the teachers a further public-sector supplement` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `pay the teachers a further supplement the public-sector agreement gives all active workers`

`the 2008 grant is a further supplement for §4(יב)` MEANS
    `§4(יב) passes the supplement on to the teachers` TRUE TRUE

#ASSERT NOT `the 2008 grant is a further supplement for §4(יב)`

-- F-hh-2008-a: in 2008 the framework's frame is (א)(1)'s 1.5%, yet it puts
-- none of it into monthly pay — it pays it to every active employee it
-- covers as the one-time grant of its §8 — so whether (יב) reaches that
-- grant is a reading (convention instruments.general-wage-agreement).
`a teacher of the State in June 2008` MEANS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2008
        `employer`                        IS `employed by the State`
        `in post-primary education`       IS FALSE
        `in the upper division`           IS FALSE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS FALSE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS FALSE
        `combined salary today`           IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 300
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 300
        `the kind of school`              IS `another school`
        `the interns the teacher mentors` IS 0
        `the classes in each grade`       IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`     IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE

`the framework pays as a grant the 1.5% that the agreement of 21.2.2008 pays as a rise` MEANS
        `the 2008 framework cost frame on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2008) EQUALS `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate` `a teacher of the State in June 2008`
    AND `the 2008 framework frame allocated to monthly pay on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2008) EQUALS 0
    AND `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate` `a teacher of the State in June 2008` GREATER THAN 0

#ASSERT `the framework pays as a grant the 1.5% that the agreement of 21.2.2008 pays as a rise`

-- The agreement's claim on the 2008 supplement (MMS-521): for a teaching
-- employee it covers, from the salary of January 2008, at (א)'s rate as
-- (יא) corrects it, on (ט)'s base; it says nothing of anyone else.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008` c IS
    IF `a teaching employee of the agreement of 21.2.2008` c AND `the salary month is at least` c 2008 1
    THEN JUST (`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement` c)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- How the agreement describes itself as an instrument (MMS-521).
`the agreement of 21.2.2008` MEANS
    `instrument` WITH
        `module`        IS "2008-02-21_teachers_tosefet-2008_wage-supplement"
        `title`         IS "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 21.2.2008 (הסתדרות המורים)"
        `kind`          IS `a collective agreement`
        `is the takanon` IS FALSE
        `issued`        IS DATE_FROM_DMY 21 2 2008
        `practised for all state employees` IS FALSE
        `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS FALSE

§§ `5–9 סכסוכים, מיצוי, שקט, הסכמים קודמים וחילוקי דעות`

-- §5: every collective labour dispute, national or local, declared or
-- announced by the signing on the matters settled here is void on the
-- signing; ¶2: the dispute of 19.12.06 among them.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1 akn:art_5/p2
GIVEN `declared on` IS A DATE, `on a matter this agreement settled` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a labour dispute is void under the agreement of 21.2.2008` `declared on` `on a matter this agreement settled` IF
        `on a matter this agreement settled`
    AND `declared on` `is on or before` `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim wage agreement was signed on`

#ASSERT `a labour dispute is void under the agreement of 21.2.2008` (DATE_FROM_DMY 19 12 2006) TRUE

-- §6: a full exhaustion of the parties' claims on the matters settled here
-- for the time to 31.12.09, and no further negotiation on them for it.
-- ¶2: among them §11 of the collective agreement "of 11.12.01" — the
-- negotiation on the final cost of the wage supplement for 1.8.01–31.12.01,
-- §11 of the parties' agreement signed on 18.12.01 (in the corpus, not yet
-- encoded; finding F-hh-2008-b) — and §§76 and 88 of the reform agreement
-- (imported): this agreement is the one §88 promises, at §76's rates and
-- dates as §76(ג) corrects them (asserted in its tests file).
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1 akn:art_6/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `on a matter this agreement settled` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 21.2.2008 exhausts the claim for` d `on a matter this agreement settled` IF
        `on a matter this agreement settled`
    AND d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2009)

`why the agreement of 18.12.01 is not here` MEANS
    `not yet encoded` "2001-12-18_histadrut-hamorim_wage-agreement-1999-2001"

-- F-hh-2008-b: ¶2 dates the agreement whose §11 it exhausts 11.12.01. The
-- corpus holds no agreement of that day; the parties' wage agreement for
-- 1999–2001 was signed on 18.12.01, and its §11 is the negotiation on the
-- final cost this agreement exhausts. Read as that agreement
-- (reading.misprint).
`the day ¶2 dates the agreement of §11` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 11 12 2001
`the day the parties' 1999–2001 wage agreement was signed` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 18 12 2001

`§6 dates the agreement whose §11 it exhausts a week before it was signed` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL `the day the parties' 1999–2001 wage agreement was signed`
    MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the day ¶2 dates the agreement of §11`
    EQUALS 7

#ASSERT `§6 dates the agreement whose §11 it exhausts a week before it was signed`

-- §7: neither party, nor any of its units, takes strike measures, full or
-- partial, or any other organised harm to work against the other, to
-- 31.12.09, on the matters settled here.
@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7/p1
`industrial peace under the agreement of 21.2.2008` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `strike over a matter the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement settled`

`the State's industrial peace under the agreement of 21.2.2008` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    SHANT `lock out over a matter the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement settled`

-- §8: terms the parties set before, in collective agreements or
-- arrangements or other written undertakings, stand while this agreement is
-- in force, unless one of its provisions changes or cancels them, expressly
-- or by implication.
@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8/p1
`earlier terms stand unless the agreement of 21.2.2008 changes them` MEANS TRUE

-- §9: a joint parity follow-up committee — the wages commissioner, the
-- union's secretary-general and the Ministry's Director-General — follows
-- the agreement and decides disputes over its reading or applying
-- unanimously (it names no time to meet, unlike §13 of the Oz agreement);
-- ¶2: its decisions are final and bind the parties.
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9/p1
`deciding disputes over the agreement of 21.2.2008` MEANS
    PARTY `the parity committee`
    MAY   `decide a dispute over the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim agreement`

GIVEN `members for` IS A NUMBER, `members` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the committee of 21.2.2008 decides` `members for` `members` IF
    `members for` EQUALS `members`

@ref akn:art_9/p2
`the 21.2.2008 committee's decisions are final and bind the parties` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties signing; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 The file number (שכ. 2008-1263); no rule.

§§ `examples`

-- A teacher of the State in post-primary education, represented by ארגון
-- המורים: §2 reaches him all the same; a local authority's teacher it does
-- not. Salaries are round placeholders.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, e IS A `the teacher's employer`, `secondary organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `teaching case`
DECIDE `a teacher of the agreement of 21.2.2008 in` y m e `secondary organisation` IS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 m y
        `employer`                        IS e
        `in post-primary education`       IS `secondary organisation`
        `in the upper division`           IS FALSE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS `secondary organisation`
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS FALSE
        `combined salary today`           IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 300
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 300
        `the kind of school`              IS `another school`
        `the interns the teacher mentors` IS 0
        `the classes in each grade`       IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`     IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008` (`a teacher of the agreement of 21.2.2008 in` 2007 12 `employed by the State` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008` (`a teacher of the agreement of 21.2.2008 in` 2008 1 `employed by the State` FALSE) EQUALS JUST 154.5
#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008` (`a teacher of the agreement of 21.2.2008 in` 2008 12 `employed by the State` FALSE) EQUALS JUST 309
#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008` (`a teacher of the agreement of 21.2.2008 in` 2009 12 `employed by the State` FALSE) EQUALS JUST 515
#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008` (`a teacher of the agreement of 21.2.2008 in` 2009 12 `employed by the State` TRUE) EQUALS JUST 515
#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008` (`a teacher of the agreement of 21.2.2008 in` 2009 12 `employed by a local authority` TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the shekel supplement as the agreement of 21.2.2008 updates it` 100 (`a teacher of the agreement of 21.2.2008 in` 2010 1 `employed by the State` FALSE) EQUALS 105
#ASSERT `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement counts for` `pensions, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`
#ASSERT NOT `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement counts for` `topping up to the minimum wage, of the Histadrut HaMorim supplement`
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement of 21.2.2008 may pay for work done on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2007)
`a cost-of-living-linked shekel supplement` MEANS `shekel supplement of 21.2.2008` WITH
    `in the teaching scale on the eve of 21.2.2008` IS TRUE
    `updated by the cost-of-living agreements` IS TRUE
    `has an update mechanism of its own` IS FALSE
    `is the minimum-wage top-up` IS FALSE
`a shekel supplement with a mechanism of its own` MEANS `shekel supplement of 21.2.2008` WITH
    `in the teaching scale on the eve of 21.2.2008` IS TRUE
    `updated by the cost-of-living agreements` IS FALSE
    `has an update mechanism of its own` IS TRUE
    `is the minimum-wage top-up` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `(ז) updates the shekel supplement` `a cost-of-living-linked shekel supplement`
#ASSERT NOT `(ז) updates the shekel supplement` `a shekel supplement with a mechanism of its own`
